      "jobId": "71c0c523-03e7-497f-b71f-da63cc236ebf",
      "prompt": "A single clump of marram dune grass growing from a small mound of dry pale sand on the plain grey studio floor: a dense upright tuft of long narrow rolled grass blades, blue-green to grey-green at the base fading to pale straw at the tips, the blades arching outward and curling over at their tips, a few dry straw-coloured dead blades and two or three slender pale seed spikes rising above the tuft, smooth sculpted forms like a quality scale model with a bold readable silhouette, with a soft contact shadow, the whole clump centred in frame and seen from the front-left. The picture shows only the grass clump on its sand mound on the plain backdrop, stylized-real diorama miniature, real PBR materials, slightly exaggerated proportions, soft noon sun, neutral grey studio background"
    },
    {
